Pile-uncopyrighted. The two dataset cards below give MIT as their licence metadata. They are derived from
https://huggingface.co/datasets/monology/pile-uncopyrighted, a subset of The Pile (Leo Gao et al., The Pile: An 800GB
Dataset of Diverse Text for Language Modeling, 2020, arXiv:2101.00027) that omits Books3, BookCorpus2, OpenSubtitles,
YTSubtitles and OWT2. The remaining components come from many sources, and their own terms may also apply to the text
(see the component list of Gao et al.). This repository does not record the component of each window. Sources:
https://huggingface.co/datasets/danbraunai/pile-uncopyrighted, revision 188e502a27a7d7d7def4568f68447decf647072c
(test shard 00000), and https://huggingface.co/datasets/danbraunai/pile-uncopyrighted-tok-shuffled, revision
6f141f6e4edc32fea842f2ece0d3477b15c3dc90 (validation shard 00000, already tokenized).
  Used in:
